[text] Phase 2b.2 complete and approved. Stopping per CLAUDE.md operating rules — wrapper will commit, then resume for 2b.3.

**Summary of changes**

- **New pure modules:**
  - `app/src/phone/qr.ts` — `tryEncodeOffer` / `tryDecodeOffer` (gzip + base64url + 1200-byte oversize gate via QR V25/EC-L)
  - `app/src/phone/pair-url.ts` — `buildPhoneUrl` / `parsePhoneFragment`
- **UI:**
  - `app/src/ui/PairScreen.tsx` — rewritten with QR state machine (`preparing-offer` → `showing-offer` → `scanning-answer` → `connected`/`error`), 10 fps throttled `jsqr` scan loop, Show-manual-pairing toggle, auto-fallback on oversize/camera-denied/missing-IP, `startedAt` reset on `connected` (M5 RTT baseline fix)
  - `app/src/phone/PhoneApp.tsx` — auto-applies `#offer=<payload>`, renders answer QR via `qrcode` lib, manual fallback on every error
  - `app/src/main.tsx`, `app/src/App.tsx` — both PhoneApp and PairScreen are now `React.lazy`-loaded
- **Tests:** +17 vitest tests (qr.ts: 7, pair-url.ts: 10) → **147/147 pass**
- **Build:** main bundle gzip **shrank** 107.55 → 106.45 KB (PhoneApp moved to its own chunk); +0 KB main-bundle budget satisfied
- **Verify:** `app/verify-phase-2b2.mjs` runs C1/C3/C5 (gate-grade, PASS) and C2/C4 (best-effort, FAIL under headless chromium per §B2 concession); M1–M6 manual QA checklist pending operator sign-off
- **Docs:** `docs/PHASES.md` marks 2b.2 ✅ shipped
- **Artifact:** `artifacts/phase-approval.json` written for `phase-2b.2`
